ing state prior to a past action."],"correctIndex":1},{"number":8,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the improvement: They could not admire his bright performance because of they dislike him.","options":["because of their disliking of him","because of their dislike him","because they dislike him","No correction required"],"correctIndex":2},{"number":9,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the improvement: She was uneasy because she never on a plane before.","options":["had never been","never been","is never been","No improvement"],"correctIndex":0},{"number":10,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the improvement: They only work when they have no money.","options":["When they have no money, they only work","They only work","work only when","No improvement"],"correctIndex":2},{"number":11,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Scarcely had the verdict been announced ______ protests erupted.","options":["than","when","then","that"],"correctIndex":1},{"number":12,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"If the evidence ______ earlier, the inquiry might have ended sooner.","options":["emerges","had emerged","would emerge","has emerged"],"correctIndex":1},{"number":13,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"Choose the correct sentence.","options":["The data indicates a decline.","The data indicate a decline.","The datas indicate a decline.","The data indicating a decline."],"correctIndex":1},{"number":14,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAssetPath":null,"questionText":"The proposal is contingent ______ parliamentary approval.","options":["at","with","upon","for"],"correctIndex":2},{"number":15,"section":"English Language","contextText":null,"imageAss